imported Unpack ignores a bottom package argument
named Unpack erases to the original STG Id
Pack passes the original payload as an STG argument
imported Unpack demands the payload only when its body does
imported Unpack returns the body result for a defined package
demanding Pack observes payload bottom
Unpack leaves a computed package unevaluated
adjacent package reduction preserves witness scope
